1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,940
You landed with no gym. This wall disagrees.

2
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:07,760
Ten minutes before dinner. Enough.

3
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:12,890
Wall push-ups first. Ten reps. Press the wall away.

4
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:19,330
Doorframe next. Lean back. Pull in. Ten rows.

5
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:22,870
Your back just trained without a single machine.

6
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:29,990
Wall sit. Thirty seconds. Legs argue. Hold anyway.

7
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:34,750
Floor now. Glute bridges. Ten slow ones.

8
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:39,720
Wall plank. Twenty seconds. Breathe.

9
00:00:40,070 --> 00:00:43,780
Repeat the round once. That's the session.

10
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:46,870
Your strength travels to every city.

11
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:49,130
You built it before dinner.

12
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:53,060
Tomorrow: the push-up staircase.

13
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:56,400
Which city are you training in tonight?
